$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=lsfiberlem5  LOC_AFTER=?

* Lemma for lsfiber: the f-weighted blocks of primitive characters over the admissible divisors f of Q are dominated by the sum over all characters mod Q of the squared twisted unit averages (Lean hsel).

